+
+1. `node <ref>/scripts/cycle/serve.mjs --dist <scratch>/cycle-beta7-dist --pid <scratch>/persona-beta-2-25-34/serve.pid`
+   (`<ref>` is `git archive e800c43 scripts/cycle …` unpacked in the scratchpad).
+2. `ln -sfn ../pw/node_modules <scratch>/persona-beta-2-25-34/node_modules`, then
+   `BASE=http://127.0.0.1:<port>/melon-seek/beta/ node <scratch>/persona-beta-2-25-34/driver.mjs <port2> <pidfile>`.
+3. Each step: `curl --data-binary @<scratch>/persona-beta-2-25-34/s/<step>.js http://127.0.0.1:<port2>/run`
+   (`p1a`…`p1q`, `p2a`…`p2i`, `p3a`…`p3n`, `p4a`…`p4h`, `p5a`…`p5h`; returns with `s/ret.js` after
+   `s/later.mjs state/<p>.json state/<p>-later.json <days> <drop>`).
